      "id": "claim_6ed3e65a640244a38f87198f177bbeaf",
      "statement": "The TestFlight workflow uses a tag-first design: it triggers on push of v*.*.* tags (from release:version) and testflight/* tags (from release:testflight-bump) plus workflow_dispatch, and never creates a tag matching either pattern itself to avoid self-retriggering; the testflight-tag step only fills GitHub prerelease notes when the tag already exists and draft Release promotion (gh release edit --draft=false) runs only for v-tags.",
